<h1>How It Works</h1>
<p class="muted">A quick tour of everything on this site — bookmark it for whenever you forget where something lives. Everything below is self-service: you never need to email or call the admin.</p>

<div class="card wide">
  <strong>Jump to:</strong>
  <ul style="margin:8px 0 0; padding-left:20px;">
    <li><a href="#confirming">Confirming you're playing</a></li>
